OL,3,GNEWSAMan who died in crash 'a rare gem
OL,4,Agone too soon'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a man who died in a crash
OL,7,Fbetween his motorbike and a car said he
OL,8,Fwas "a rare gem gone too soon".
OL,10,FShayan Cooper, 24, died following the
OL,11,Fcollision in Harvest Ride in Bracknell
OL,12,Fat about 16:25 BST on 8 October.
OL,14,FThe loss of Cooper, who was from the
OL,15,Ftown, has left his family "heartbroken
OL,16,Fand created a void that words cannot
OL,17,Fadequately describe", his mother said.
OL,19,F"Shayan was more than a son and
OL,20,Fbrother; he was our pillar of strength,
OL,21,Fa voice of wisdom and an irreplaceable
OL,22,Fanchor in our lives," she added.
